<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - EMV H1 PROFIT 12.1 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - EMV H1 PROFIT 12.1 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction company EMV said on Friday that its half-year operating profit was 12.1 million kroons, including June profit of 4.3 million kroons.</p>
<p>Its net turnover was 160.5 million kroons, it added in a statement.  </p>
<p>EMV said the results were in line with its forecasts and expected its earnings in the second half to grow by at least the same pace.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
